{"title":"2020 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Negatives)_(Fastest)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Negatives) (Fastest)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assuming <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/f/75f300fba21a5399e8806d4aeca22ddf155d7274.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\neq3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/a/93ab3abb6c3ef9edf35fed2eb2c20fb75fc79bf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\neq4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/d/34d511ecb6d01b4da66be9a9387b94a154e15d76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c\\neq5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"17\" />, what is the value in simplest form of the following expression?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/926ff7e4cb0ce3392334f8215dd3aa4c51438f15.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a-3}{5-c} \\cdot \\frac{b-4}{3-a} \\cdot \\frac{c-5}{4-b}\\]\" width=\"155\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/a/0aa54b1883a1819e24ec0a42e35d8e5a89314a20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } {-}1 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } \\frac{abc}{60} \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\frac{1}{abc} - \\frac{1}{60} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\frac{1}{60} - \\frac{1}{abc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"519\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Negatives.29_.28Fastest.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Negatives)_(Fastest)\">Solution 1 (Negatives) (Fastest)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Negatives) (Fastest)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/9/209ee75fb0140d08c1d3fa9086edd8d5e99470d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\neq y,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"17\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/2/522a67aea41a70e1acaf5d4d0895a4b95240c81d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x-y}{y-x}=-1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"101\" height=\"41\" /> We use this fact to simplify the original expression:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/7/6772947b7c8cd9af853e09759abd7ebc2173f282.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\color{red}\\overset{-1}{\\cancel{a-3}}}{\\color{blue}\\underset{1}{\\cancel{5-c}}} \\cdot \\frac{\\color{green}\\overset{-1}{\\cancel{b-4}}}{\\color{red}\\underset{1}{\\cancel{3-a}}} \\cdot \\frac{\\color{blue}\\overset{-1}{\\cancel{c-5}}}{\\color{green}\\underset{1}{\\cancel{4-b}}}=(-1)(-1)(-1)=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } {-}1}.\\]\" width=\"394\" height=\"59\" />\n~CoolJupit ~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab583ebc85d3af4fb8f0a44be8b54ba8ee90353.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(4,5,6),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"144\" height=\"20\" /> the answer choices become\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/f/13ff32a91ad8ef245745faef2f62c9f52c93beb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } {-}1 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } {-}\\frac{1}{120} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\frac{1}{120}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"428\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>and the original expression becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/b/69ba588f0dec9a22afadecee1e319cac8622cfc2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{-1}{1}\\cdot\\frac{-1}{1}\\cdot\\frac{-1}{1}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } {-}1}.\\]\" width=\"204\" height=\"37\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/e/89e31e4859d1815085e630ea452b307ba875b3db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = a - 3, y = b - 4,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/d/42d4e9f8fe3b825f996028034651f8d0a38a274c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 5 - c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />. Now, the problem simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/2/9227cd7bd2e88f44dfbad50c6b21a871793a8cd3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x}{z}\\cdot\\frac{-y}{x}\\cdot\\frac{z}{y}=\\frac{-xyz}{xyz}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } {-}1}.\\]\" width=\"249\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p>Explanation: After substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, the opposites (for example <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/d/a5d137ec5e93197b867caa1f3709e3cc17009543.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 - c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/5/605e67619c40da36f5c82bdcb4a677b8d4749bdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c - 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />) can just be written as the negative of each. With the same example, this can be shown by: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/2/8e23a97c1cab1ff075468e2be5bc95edf188ac7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c - 5 = -(5 - c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>~GREATEST\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/WUcbVNy2uv0\">https://youtu.be/WUcbVNy2uv0</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Nrdxe4UAqkA\">https://youtu.be/Nrdxe4UAqkA</a>\n</p><p>Education, The Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7-3sl1pSojc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7-3sl1pSojc</a>\n</p><p>~bobthefam\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZccL6yKrTiU\">https://youtu.be/ZccL6yKrTiU</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_5\">Video Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ba6w1OhXqOQ?t=956\">https://youtu.be/ba6w1OhXqOQ?t=956</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1p